From f33718cad8546c98426fd6e1931221683d20bdd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:46:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Hades: clang-format on the lines of this version

clang-format of the toolchain (LLVM 23.1.5, with Kodi's .clang-format)
on the lines of C++ under xbmc/ that Hades wrote in this version
(clang-format --lines on them, as git blame gives them). Only the
layout changes: the code of each file without blanks and comments is
the same, but for long string literals split in adjacent ones, the
includes in their order (and one that ActiveAE.cpp had twice, once).
